---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Relaflow"
  description="Relaflow's Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store and protect personal information."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 pt-20 pb-16 md:px-10 md:pt-28 md:pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest2 text-teal">
        Legal
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl leading-[1.1] sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-white/50">
        Last updated: 27 August 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-12 text-white/75">

        <div>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow respects your privacy and is committed to handling personal information responsibly.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            This Privacy Policy explains how Relaflow collects, uses, stores, and protects personal information when you use relaflow.com, subscribe to The Business of Relationships Brief, contact us, or engage us for advisory or training services.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow is responsible for the personal information it collects and determines how that information is used.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            1. Information We Collect
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Depending on how you interact with Relaflow, we may collect the following information.
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl text-white">
            Newsletter subscribers
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            When you subscribe to The Business of Relationships Brief, we collect your email address and, where provided, your name and other information associated with your subscription.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Newsletter subscriptions are managed through Substack.
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl text-white">
            Contact enquiries
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            When you contact Relaflow through the website or by email, we may collect your name, email address, organization details, and the information contained in your message.
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl text-white">
            Website usage information
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            We may collect limited technical and usage information about how visitors use the website, such as pages visited, general traffic information, browser or device information, and similar information where necessary to operate, secure, and improve the website.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow does not currently use tracking cookies beyond what is necessary for basic website functionality, unless this policy is updated to reflect additional analytics, advertising, or other tracking technologies.
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl text-white">
            Advisory and training clients
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            When you engage Relaflow for advisory or training services, we may collect information necessary to provide those services.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            This may include contact details, organization information, project information, and information you choose to provide about your organization's relationship-management practices, systems, processes, clients, partners, sponsors, communities, or stakeholders.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Where an engagement involves access to personal information belonging to your organization or other individuals, the handling of that information will also be governed by the relevant written agreement between Relaflow and the client.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            2. How We Use Personal Information
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We use personal information for purposes including:
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
            <li>Providing and managing newsletter subscriptions</li>
            <li>Sending The Business of Relationships Brief and related communications you have requested</li>
            <li>Responding to enquiries and requests</li>
            <li>Providing advisory and training services</li>
            <li>Managing client and business relationships</li>
            <li>Delivering resources, guides, frameworks, and other materials</li>
            <li>Operating, maintaining, securing, and improving the website</li>
            <li>Understanding how our website and resources are used</li>
            <li>Complying with applicable legal and contractual obligations</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We do not sell your personal information.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We will not use your personal information for unrelated purposes without a lawful basis for doing so.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            3. Newsletter
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Our newsletter is delivered and managed through Substack.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            When you subscribe, the information you provide is processed by Substack in accordance with its own terms and privacy practices.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            You can unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time using the unsubscribe option included in newsletter communications.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            4. Third-Party Services
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow may use third-party service providers to operate parts of the website and deliver its services.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
            <li><strong class="text-white">Substack</strong>, for newsletter publishing, delivery, and subscriber management</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Cloudflare</strong>, for website hosting, security, performance, and related infrastructure</li>
            <li>Other service providers that may be introduced where reasonably necessary to operate the business or deliver services</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Third-party providers may process information on Relaflow's behalf or process information independently under their own terms.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Where required, Relaflow will take reasonable steps to ensure that appropriate safeguards are in place when personal information is shared with third parties.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            5. International Data Transfers
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Some service providers used by Relaflow may process or store information outside Kenya.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Where personal information is transferred outside Kenya, Relaflow will take reasonable steps to ensure that the transfer is carried out in accordance with applicable data-protection requirements and that appropriate safeguards are in place.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            6. How We Protect Information
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow takes reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect personal information against unauthorized access, loss, misuse, alteration, or disclosure.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            However, no website, email service, or online system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Where a data breach occurs that is subject to notification requirements under applicable law, Relaflow will take the required steps to respond and notify the relevant parties.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            7. Data Retention
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, to provide our services, maintain appropriate business records, resolve disputes, comply with legal obligations, or protect our legitimate interests.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Newsletter information is generally retained while you remain subscribed, unless there is another lawful reason to retain it.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Contact information may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary to respond to an enquiry or maintain appropriate business records.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Client information will generally be retained according to the relevant engagement agreement and applicable legal or business requirements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            8. Your Rights
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Depending on applicable law, you may have rights regarding your personal information, including the right to:
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
            <li>Be informed about how your personal information is used</li>
            <li>Request access to personal information we hold about you</li>
            <li>Request correction of inaccurate or misleading information</li>
            <li>Request deletion of personal information where applicable</li>
            <li>Object to certain processing of your personal information</li>
            <li>Request restriction of processing in applicable circumstances</li>
            <li>Request portability of your personal information where applicable</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
            <li>Unsubscribe from marketing or newsletter communications</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            To exercise these rights, contact us at
            <a href="mailto:hello@relaflow.com" class="text-teal hover:text-white">
              hello@relaflow.com
            </a>.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We may need to verify your identity before responding to certain requests.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We will respond to requests within the period required by applicable law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            9. Complaints
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            If you have concerns about how Relaflow handles your personal information, please contact us first at
            <a href="mailto:hello@relaflow.com" class="text-teal hover:text-white">
              hello@relaflow.com
            </a>
            so that we can investigate and address the issue.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            You may also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Office of the Data Protection Commissioner of Kenya or another relevant data-protection authority where applicable.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            10. Advisory and Training Engagements
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Where Relaflow provides advisory or training services and the work involves access to an organization's confidential information, relationship data, CRM records, or personal information belonging to other individuals, the specific responsibilities of Relaflow and the client will be set out in a separate written agreement.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            That agreement may address confidentiality, data protection, security, permitted uses of information, retention, access, and other project-specific requirements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            11. Cookies and Similar Technologies
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow currently does not use advertising cookies or tracking cookies beyond what is required for basic website functionality.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            If this changes, this Privacy Policy will be updated to explain the technologies used and, where required, the choices available to visitors.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            12. Children's Privacy
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow's website, newsletter, resources, training, and advisory services are intended for organizations and general audiences and are not directed specifically at children.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We do not knowingly collect personal information from children for marketing purposes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            13. Changes to This Privacy Policy
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our services, technology, legal requirements, or data-handling practices.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            The "Last updated" date at the top of this policy indicates when the policy was most recently revised.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            14. Contact Us
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, your personal information, or how Relaflow handles data, contact:
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-white">Relaflow</strong><br />
            <a href="mailto:hello@relaflow.com" class="text-teal hover:text-white">
              hello@relaflow.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>